{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-08",
  "title": "暗淡者之火",
  "storyCode": "7-10",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "70bb31ae8e75ff679f60a2da3d16f9467e1c7c461dd87f4a01dad88285bc123c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guard，解釋你的作為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看起來完全是個整合運動了......是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你們認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那這個卡特斯感染者說的一切都是謊話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和整合運動原本就是一邊的！對不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塔季......你找到食物了嗎？避難處的大家也撐不了太長時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還要逼我多久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先讓你到安全的地方再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要靠近她，Guard！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道事情很難解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們最好都小心些。這個區域裡所有的烏薩斯被動感染者......都過得非常糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們中的大多數已經處在精神崩潰的邊緣......就只差有人推那麼一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把這叫做“糟”？你們這些殺人狂！你們這些骯髒的虐待狂！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也被......我也被你們弄成這樣！變成這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你再不走，就會被魔族人找到，然後丟給其他整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛國者的部隊已經被完全調出這個區域了。你被抓住，我就徹底沒辦法救你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就讓我死好了！就讓我死在這片你們這些怪物橫行的地上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼遊擊隊，什麼感染者的盾......他們有區別嗎？和其他整合運動有區別嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有。沒有他們，我們都已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你解釋給我聽，解釋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他們真的像你這幾天說的那樣只做對的事，為什麼他們還待在這整合運動？為什麼他們會讓這裡變成這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不反抗？為什麼不出走？！為什麼知道我們被殺，被褻瀆，被報復卻還是讓這些事情發生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的遊擊隊為什麼沒和這些巡邏的魔族怪物廝殺？！為什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看著它們親手，親手......用手就扯掉了......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛國者看不見的地方太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當需要愛國者指揮他的隊伍才能捍衛其他人生存權利的時候，我就知道這裡已經出了問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使如此......只要還有遊擊隊會從這裡走過，就不會有險惡的整合運動成員踏足這片區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這已經區別了暴徒和遊擊隊戰士。愛國者手下的，即使是薩卡茲，也比許多普通整合運動感染者更守規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他們為什麼不在這裡？！為什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不在以後，剩下的那些感染者只是更殘暴更惡劣地對待我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是他們的錯嗎？這不是遊擊隊的錯嗎！沒有遊擊隊，他們就不會這麼對我們了，對不對？！他們在報復遊擊隊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊擊隊做的沒錯。就像你自己也那麼覺得......其他人有可能是在報復遊擊隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那整合運動報復遊擊隊的原因，就只是因為遊擊隊戰士在捍衛你們活下去的機會。只會如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。遊擊隊......甚至在捍衛你們的尊嚴。我親眼看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到那個戰士命令其他整合運動喊你們名字，而不是數字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，遊擊隊留下我們，就是為了在他們不在的時候幫助你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......整個切爾諾伯格已經被切割成了許多塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許有些地方還駐紮著遊擊隊員，但他們不在的地方......如果沒人維持紀律，那麼就只能靠我們......領你們活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕我們可能根本活不下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，我剛才說的，你相信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡特斯女孩，你看......你看！他是整合運動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們難道要信整合運動嗎？還有，我，我變成感染者就該信整合運動的胡說八道了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看，剛才你說那些要殺我們的，不也是整合運動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在變成感染者，整合運動難道就待我更好了嗎？所以我怎麼知道你們誰是誰，你們誰要殺我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，整合運動，全都該......全都該......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（阿米婭。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（醫生？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（接下來別衝動。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，我們應該繼續向上走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會是她......！怎麼是她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......要徹底消滅整合運動嗎？！羅德島也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不管怎樣！這附近的薩卡茲傭兵巡邏隊，會在這個時間段經過這個倉庫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不處理他們，或者不躲好的話，很容易就會被他們發現，擄走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上普通整合運動的巡邏隊，我們只有一點點時間能出來尋找物資！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因為這樣，許多人食不果腹，還缺乏必要藥品，死亡在切爾諾伯格的居民中蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，凱爾希醫生！還有......Dr.{@nickname}，如果可以的話，至少相信我這些話，至少我們先躲起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guard......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏薩斯的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在叫我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏薩斯的感染者，我誠懇地向你諮詢數個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你的口音......你是從帝國首都來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你的用詞，好老舊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受過高等教育。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我以前是大學的抄寫員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，拜你們感染者所賜，一切都毀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你信任你身後那位，曾經身為我們雇員的現整合運動感染者嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他......是你們的雇員？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島在戰鬥狀態中，有為無辜感染者處理生存問題的職能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是否無辜，我們尚無法判斷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你做什麼！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你那個，什麼，是，唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒想到我自己有被Mon3tr抓住的這天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抵在你脖子上的這部分鋒刃，切入角只有8度，深入6mm就足夠切開你的大動脈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，呃......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他有像自己所說的那樣堅定地保護你們的生存權嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你問的是什麼......你這麼問，要幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他和他所屬的整合運動，不分是哪一部分，有威脅到你的生命，甚至做出傷害你的舉動嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如實回答，我會按照你的回答來處理他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你用他的命威脅我？！我和他......和他......根本就沒有關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "落實到他個人，他有跟隨整合運動犯下侵害他人的罪行嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生......不要侮辱我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能採信的只有目擊者與受害者。既然你聲稱保證了她的生存權，那麼能判斷你是否犯下罪行的唯一證據，就是這位小姐的證詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你所說的一切都只是一面之詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可她說的難道不也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的身份與你不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有力量。你具備施加暴力的能力，無論這種暴力被你用來做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感受到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，是薩卡茲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目標個體已經十分靠近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就不能......可他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是否曾經為你們抵擋其他整合運動？他是否切實地使你們免遭充滿攻擊性的整合運動的侵害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生......！巡邏隊已經到了！這個不是......不是遊擊隊的巡邏隊！不能，不能讓他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不講道理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認為我們的行為完全符合烏薩斯倫理道德的要求，是你對他進行了指控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他......他確實每次都這時候出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生！讓我去......攔那些薩卡茲人！如果不這樣......我至少可以騙他們！讓他們不走這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說出來。否則沒人知道真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直線距離二十四米。很近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十二米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有！從來沒有！起碼他從來沒做過壞事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_057",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正，反正我沒有見過！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭。博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "演得可真像。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀......醫生！我就知道......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我們走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目標，整合運動的薩卡茲巡邏隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guard，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你誤會我了。但我會保護你。我會替你報復它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們對你們，對我的家人，對普通人做的，我全都要報復一遍，全都要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
